+      "reasoning": "The code acknowledges the limitation internally (completion-host.ts:28 'reported provenance, not a cryptographic attestation'; readiness.ts:253-258 labels host-question answers 'not by a card' in the checklist), but nothing in publish.ts carries it to the published body. No signal or practice source argues against telling readers."
